{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016115648330-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016135823\"/><p>事發在皇后大道中1號匯豐總行大廈。(吳鎮興攝)</p><p>今日(16日)早上11時39分，中環皇后大道中1號匯豐總行大廈，有銀行職員報案，指有數名人士到上址要求開設戶口，職員辦理手續期間，發現涉事人提交的文件中有部分懷疑為虛假文書，遂報案求助。警員接報到場，正調查事件原委。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T06:19:49.084362+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T03:56:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T06:17:51.724619+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T06:17:51.724619+00:00","content_hash":"a81aa8e9176dc1cf5389ff1b1b4dba895a8e1a7389d9b59b8ca95b933f2087d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}